    <innerclass refid="class_decay" prot="public">Decay</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the abstract <ref refid="class_decay" kindref="compound">Decay</ref> class for modeling decay processes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_decay" kindref="compound">Decay</ref> class represents decay dynamics for quantities such as mass or energy. It provides a common interface for different types of decay, such as linear decay or no decay. </para>
